Error [E3401]: `readit` calls the impure function `files.read`
  --> pure_fn_with_core_effect_is_e3401.jet:3:46
    |
  3 | fn readit(p: String) -[]> String { return fs.read(p) ?? "" }
    |                                              ^^^^
 Why: `files.read` is impure, but `readit` declares `-[]>`
 Fix: Remove the call from `readit`, or drop the `-[]>` bound from `readit` so its effects are inferred
 Denial: pure
 Call chain: readit → files.read
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E3401
